[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_HAMBURGER]
Ponyville Hay Burger Chain Store

[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_HAMBURGER_desc]
Though Trixie has no good feelings for the twins, during the long-term dealings with Las Pegasus, she must admit that the two brothers have their own wisdom.\nIf Las Pegasus Military Industries Group cna have a pizzeria, why can’t Duchess of Ponyville run a burger chain store?\nOf course, Las Pegasus market has been occupied by the pizzeria, we should try other big cities - such as Eastern Equestria?\nDon’t ask, if you have to, I’ll tell you it’s just collusion between government and business, bribery and corruption, that’s all.

[en.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_HAMBURGER_TOOLTIP]
Only if gangsters in Eastern Equestria have been eliminated, can normal business activities can be carried out without interference.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_HAMBURGER]
小马谷汉堡连锁店

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_HAMBURGER_desc]
虽然特丽克西对两兄弟没什么好感，但在长期与洛马基打交道的过程中，她也感受到了他们兄弟俩的智慧。\n既然洛马基军工集团可以下属油嘴滑舌披萨店，那么小马谷公爵为什么不能运营一家连锁汉堡店呢？\n当然，洛马基的市场已经被披萨店占领了，我们应该试试其他大城市——比如东小马利亚？\n别问，问就是政商勾结，贪污腐败了。

[zh.FOCUS_C02_ARMY_HAMBURGER_TOOLTIP]
只有盘踞在东小马利亚的黑社会已经被消灭，正常的商业活动才得以不受干扰地进行。

